ative contact(s)\nSchool of Medicine Research Degrees Office\nAdministrative contact\npgrmedic@cardiff.ac.uk\n+44 (0)29 2074 6716\nApply\nQualification\nChoose your qualification\nDoctor of Medicine\nMaster of Philosophy\nDoctor of Philosophy\nMode of study\nChoose a mode of study\nStart date\nChoose a start date\nApply now\nAdmissions policies\nPhD Studentships and projects\nSee the range of PhD studentships and projects currently available.\nView\nRelated courses\nTaught Medicine courses\nResearch Medicine programmes\nRelated subjects\nBiomedical sciences\nBiophysics\nBiosciences\nMedicine\nNeuroscience\nPharmacy\nPsychology\nSocial sciences\nStatistics\nPharmacology\nPhysiology\nChemistry\nComputer science\nRelated links\nPostgraduate tuition fees\nAdmissions criteria for postgraduate study\nInformation for your country\nPostgraduate\nProgress happens when extraordinary people come together to think about what matters most. Join a community where everyone is empowered to reach their potential and make a difference.\nPostgraduate prospectus 2027\nDownload a copy of our prospectus, school and subject brochures, and other guides.\nOrder or download\nContact us\nGet in touch if you have a question about studying with us.\nThe University\nAcademic Schools\nVisitor information\nContact us\nEmergency contacts\nPublic information\nOur facilities\nLibraries\nConferences\nResearch equipment\nSport\nConnect with us\nNew students\nAlumni\nBlogs\nQuick links\nJob opportunities\nIntranet\nMedia centre\nPeople\nResearch Portal\nCopyright Cardiff University. Registered charity no. 1136855\nAccessibility statement\nModern Slavery statement\nPrivacy\nTerms of use\nCookies\nContact Us", "links": [["Skip to main content", "https://www.cardiff.ac.uk/study/postgraduate/research/programmes/programme/medicine#page-title"], ["Teaching excellence", "https://www.cardiff.ac.uk/teaching-excellence"], ["Alumni", "https://www.cardiff.ac.uk/alumni"], ["Donate", "https://www.cardiff.ac.uk/donate